  "verseCount": 10,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JON 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jonah Goes to Nineveh",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.3.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.3.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to Jonah a second time:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Go to the great city of Nineveh and proclaim to it the message I give you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonah obeyed the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JON.3.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JON.3.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and went to Nineveh. Now Nineveh was a very large city; it took three days to go through it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jonah began by going a day's journey into the city, proclaiming, \"Forty more days and Nineveh will be overthrown.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Ninevites believed God. A fast was proclaimed, and all of them, from the greatest to the least, put on sackcloth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jonah's warning reached the king of Nineveh, he rose from his throne, took off his royal robes, covered himself with sackcloth and sat down in the dust.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the proclamation he issued in Nineveh:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pmo",
        "vid": "JON 3:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"By the decree of the king and his nobles:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm",
        "vid": "JON 3:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Do not let people or animals, herds or flocks, taste anything; do not let them eat or drink.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But let people and animals be covered with sackcloth. Let everyone call urgently on God. Let them give up their evil ways and their violence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who knows? God may yet relent and with compassion turn from his fierce anger so that we will not perish.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When God saw what they did and how they turned from their evil ways, he relented and did not bring on them the destruction he had threatened.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
